T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The PINK1-Parkin Mitophagy Pathway and Neurodegeneration:) Tj
T*
(   1. Physiological Role:) Tj
T*
(   Mitophagy is the selective autophagic elimination of dysfunctional, depolarized mitochondria,) Tj
T*
(   preventing toxic ROS accumulation and pro-apoptotic cytochrome c leakage.) Tj
T*
