(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss the biochemical mechanisms of Cellular Senescence, contrasting replicative senescence \(telomere attrition\) with oncogene-induced senescence \(OIS\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Molecular Pathophysiology of Cellular Senescence:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition and Core Features:) Tj
T*
(   Cellular senescence is a state of permanent, irreversible cell cycle arrest in G1 phase) Tj
T*
(   accompanied by resistance to apoptosis, metabolic hyperactivity, altered chromatin) Tj
T*
(   \(Senescence-Associated Heterochromatin Foci - SAHF\), expression of Senescence-Associated) Tj
T*
(   beta-Galactosidase \(SA-beta-gal at pH 6.0\), and secretion of a pro-inflammatory cocktail termed) Tj
T*
(   the Senescence-Associated Secretory Phenotype \(SASP\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Replicative Senescence \(The Hayflick Limit and Telomere Exhaustion\):) Tj
T*
(   - The End-Replication Problem: Due to the requirement for RNA primers and unidirectional) Tj
T*
(   5'-to-3' synthesis, DNA Polymerase cannot replicate the extreme 3' lagging-end of linear) Tj
T*
(   chromosomes, losing 50-100 bp per round of division.) Tj
T*
(   - Shelterin Breakdown: Telomeres consist of TTAGGG tandem hexamer repeats capped by the) Tj
T*
(   six-protein Shelterin complex \(TRF1, TRF2, RAP1, TIN2, TPP1, POT1\), which folds the) Tj
T*
(   single-stranded 3' overhang into a protective T-loop.) Tj
T*
(   - When telomeres erode below a critical threshold \(~4-5 kb\), TRF2 dissociates; the uncapped) Tj
T*
(   chromosome end is recognized by the cell as an authentic, irreparable double-strand break) Tj
T*
(   \(Telomere-Induced Foci - TIFs\).) Tj
T*
(   - This fires chronic ATM-Chk2-p53 signaling, driving sustained high p21 expression that) Tj
T*
(   permanently locks Rb in the unphosphorylated, growth-arrested state.) Tj
T*
(   3. Oncogene-Induced Senescence \(OIS\):) Tj
T*
(   - Aberrant hyperactivation of strong oncogenes \(e.g., mutant oncogenic B-Raf-V600E or) Tj
T*
(   H-Ras-V12\) in normal non-transformed cells triggers explosive, aberrant origin firing.) Tj
T*
(   - Collapsing replication forks deplete nucleotide pools and generate massive double-strand) Tj
T*
(   breaks \(Replication Stress\).) Tj
T*
(   - This fires continuous ATR/ATM signaling, activating p53.) Tj
T*
(   - Concurrently, oncogenic Ras hyperactivates the CDKN2A promoter via the Ets family of) Tj
T*
(   transcription factors, driving massive, sustained synthesis of p16 \(INK4a\).) Tj
T*
(   - High p16 directly shuts off CDK4/6, completely locking Rb and establishing permanent) Tj
T*
(   oncogene-induced senescence, acting as a potent innate barrier against tumor formation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
