(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the role of the Kinetochore-Localized Ndc80 and Ska1 Complexes in coupling chromosome movement to microtubule depolymerization.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Coupling Kinetochores to Depolymerizing Microtubules: The Ndc80-Ska1 Machinery:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Biophysical Challenge of Anaphase A:) Tj
T*
(   During Anaphase A, sister chromatids travel toward spindle poles while remaining continuously) Tj
T*
(   tethered to the shortening plus-ends of kinetochore microtubules. Crucially, chromosome) Tj
T*
